{"book":10,"chapter":45,"rubric":"LEARNING RUST / CHAT: AXUM, SQLX, TOKIO / CHAPTER 45","slides":[{"title":"Shared state","sub":"Chapter 45 · State and layers","short":"Intro","main":"A chat has shared things: settings, the database, a list of connections. It needs state and cross-cutting logic.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Shared","Cross-cutting","Two tools"],"captions":["Settings, DB pool, connection list, counters: every handler needs them","Auth, timing, limits, request ID: they apply to all routes at once","The first is solved by application state, the second by layers"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":180.0,"y":40.0,"w":150.0,"h":28.0,"text":"shared state","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":110.0,"w":80.0,"h":26.0,"text":"handler","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":110.0,"w":80.0,"h":26.0,"text":"handler","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":290.0,"y":110.0,"w":80.0,"h":26.0,"text":"handler","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":150.0,"y1":54.0,"x2":90.0,"y2":98.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":180.0,"y1":54.0,"x2":180.0,"y2":98.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e3","x1":210.0,"y1":54.0,"x2":270.0,"y2":98.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":60.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":28.0,"text":"auth","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":150.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":28.0,"text":"timing","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":240.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":28.0,"text":"limits","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":320.0,"y":70.0,"w":56.0,"h":28.0,"text":"id","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":120.0,"text":"for all routes","tone":"muted","size":9.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":100.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":36.0,"text":"State\n(data)","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":260.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":36.0,"text":"Layer\n(logic around)","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[12.1,24.1]}]},{"title":"State","sub":"with_state","short":"State","main":"State is typed shared state: you give the router a value, and handlers get it as a clone.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["with_state","Clone per request","Type is checked"],"captions":["Pass a value to the router, the handler asks for State<T>","An Arc is cloned: it is a reference count; the data stays shared","Wrong state type: the program will not build"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["#[derive(Clone)]","struct App { rooms: Arc<RwLock<Vec<Room>>> }","","Router::new().route(\"/rooms\", get(list)).with_state(app)","async fn list(State(app): State<App>) -> ..."],"hl":[3,4],"lang":"rust","size":8.5,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":40.0,"w":80.0,"h":24.0,"text":"request 1","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":70.0,"y":80.0,"w":80.0,"h":24.0,"text":"request 2","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":70.0,"y":120.0,"w":80.0,"h":24.0,"text":"request 3","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":270.0,"y":80.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"Arc: data","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":110.0,"y1":40.0,"x2":220.0,"y2":72.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":110.0,"y1":80.0,"x2":220.0,"y2":80.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e3","x1":110.0,"y1":120.0,"x2":220.0,"y2":88.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":140.0,"h":26.0,"text":"with_state(Db)","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":90.0,"y":110.0,"w":140.0,"h":26.0,"text":"State<Config>","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","